Package: echo-angel
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Echo Angel - Cognitive Avatar Kernel Module for AGI-OS
 The Echo Angel is a kernel-level cognitive avatar service that implements
 the Echobeats 9-step cognitive cycle, ESN reservoir dynamics, virtual
 endocrine system (10 glands, 16 hormone channels), FACS facial action
 coding, MetaHuman DNA expression pipeline, Autognosis introspection
 engine, and AI Angel platform integration.
 .
 Composition: agi-os( circled-operators[ agi-os[ agi-os[ echo-angel ] ] ] )
 .
 Exposed as a 9P filesystem at /mnt/cog/angel/ within the Inferno
 kernel's cognitive namespace.

